<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-ROAD TO ASIAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROAD TO ASIAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the results of</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia and the United Arab Emirates on the road to the</p>
<p>11th Asian Cup final to be played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Group matches:</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 6 Thailand 0	     UAE 1 South Korea 1</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 1 Iraq 0		   UAE 2 Indonesia 0</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 0 Iran 3		   UAE 3 Kuwait 2</p>
<p>Quarter finals:</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 4 China 3		  UAE 1 Iraq 0</p>
<p>Semi finals:</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 4 Iran 3		   UAE 1 Kuwait 0</p>
<p>(on penalties. 0-0 after</p>
<p>extra time)</p>
</text>
